{"availability":"available","full":"Abdulrahman-hayatu/compliance-agent","name":"compliance-agent","description":"A4-agent LangGraph compliance system (Retriever → Analyzer → Validator → Reporter) using FAISS RAG over CBN and NDPC regulatory documents, Groq LLaMA-3.3-70b inference, and Gradio UI deployed on HuggingFace Spaces.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-14T21:26:51Z","updated":"2026-09-20T11:43:38Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Abdulrahman-Hayatu/Nigerian-fintech-compliance-agent","topics":["faiss","gradio","groq-api","huggingface-spaces","langgraph","langraph","pdfplumber","python","sentence-transformers"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Abdulrahman-Hayatu/Nigerian-fintech-compliance-agent","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:03.169Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:03.169Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:03.169Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:45.487Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T19:49:03.169Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A multi-agent LLM application that checks fintech policy documents against Nigerian regulatory frameworks. Upload a PDF or TXT policy document and the pipeline extracts discrete policy claims, retrieves relevant regulatory clauses from a pre-built FAISS vector index, assesses each claim for compliance, and produces a structured markdown report with a prioritised remediation checklist. The tool covers two frameworks: the CBN Circular and Guidelines for the Operations of Agent Banking in Nigeria (October 6, 2025) and the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 (NDPC)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Abdulrahman-hayatu/compliance-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5a97f41a3ed417b0b6b891bf6d47550b4a95c7e785cbbdd821a9ab2484d90e9d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:45.621Z"},"overviewCheckedAt"